{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Hey Melanie! Long time no talk! A lot's been going on in my life! Take a look at this."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-cf5524cb74b1dffcf28e4206", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.369924+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf5524cb74b1dffcf28e4206", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf5524cb74b1dffcf28e4206", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey, Caroline! Nice to hear from you! Love the necklace, any special meaning to it?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-7c42809aee969b2def975f59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.385594+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c42809aee969b2def975f59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c42809aee969b2def975f59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! This necklace is super special to me - a gift from my grandma in my home country, Sweden. She gave it to me when I was young, and it stands for love, faith and strength. It's like a reminder of my roots and all the love and support I get from my family."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-aa1a2eca778b097a5f7cd252", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.399508+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa1a2eca778b097a5f7cd252", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa1a2eca778b097a5f7cd252", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That's gorgeous, Caroline! It's awesome what items can mean so much to us, right? Got any other objects that you treasure, like that necklace?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-c80069e7de23fdbcdc711b45", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.412514+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c80069e7de23fdbcdc711b45", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c80069e7de23fdbcdc711b45", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Yep, Melanie! I've got some other stuff with sentimental value, like my hand-painted bowl. A friend made it for my 18th birthday ten years ago. The pattern and colors are awesome-- it reminds me of art and self-expression."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-dafdf722f425254dd1102309", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.428042+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dafdf722f425254dd1102309", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dafdf722f425254dd1102309", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That sounds great, Caroline! It's awesome having stuff around that make us think of good connections and times. Actually, I just took my fam camping in the mountains last week - it was a really nice time together!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-803be40cb2f3a8e82cd2bf9b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.440991+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "803be40cb2f3a8e82cd2bf9b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "803be40cb2f3a8e82cd2bf9b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Sounds great, Mel. Glad you made some new family mems. How was it? Anything fun?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-2d3f9f7c26d7c1f79f0a4f74", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.455526+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d3f9f7c26d7c1f79f0a4f74", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d3f9f7c26d7c1f79f0a4f74", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: It was an awesome time, Caroline! We explored nature, roasted marshmallows around the campfire and even went on a hike. The view from the top was amazing! The 2 younger kids love nature. It was so special having these moments together as a family - I'll never forget it!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-ce75ae4c0f05a1ca7885419c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.468003+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce75ae4c0f05a1ca7885419c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce75ae4c0f05a1ca7885419c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That's awesome, Melanie! Family moments like that are so special. Glad y'all had such a great time."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-23ac0dee67944cf076857ac8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.482813+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "23ac0dee67944cf076857ac8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "23ac0dee67944cf076857ac8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Family time matters to me. What's up with you lately?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-1a7b9b231c9433b4720393c6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.494390+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a7b9b231c9433b4720393c6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a7b9b231c9433b4720393c6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Lately, I've been looking into counseling and mental health as a career. I want to help people who have gone through the same things as me."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-730410c6f7735acc7e2a5112", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.505023+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "730410c6f7735acc7e2a5112", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "730410c6f7735acc7e2a5112", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Sounds great! What kind of counseling and mental health services do you want to persue?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-2178cfdc89bed6874abc4744", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.517887+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2178cfdc89bed6874abc4744", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2178cfdc89bed6874abc4744", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: I'm still figuring out the details, but I'm thinking of working with trans people, helping them accept themselves and supporting their mental health. Last Friday, I went to an LGBTQ+ counseling workshop and it was really enlightening. They talked about different therapeutic methods and how to best work with trans people. Seeing how passionate these pros were about making a safe space for people like me was amazing."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-dd8bff8ec58edaf739fd2428", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.527366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dd8bff8ec58edaf739fd2428", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dd8bff8ec58edaf739fd2428", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Woah, Caroline, it sounds like you're doing some impressive work. It's inspiring to see your dedication to helping others. What motivated you to pursue counseling?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-093738684d920264b855925d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.544014+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "093738684d920264b855925d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "093738684d920264b855925d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. It really mattered. My own journey and the support I got made a huge difference. Now I want to help people go through it too. I saw how counseling and support groups improved my life, so I started caring more about mental health and understanding myself. Now I'm passionate about creating a safe, inviting place for people to grow."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-c1bbc6f45ec81aba4f1e672c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.557315+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c1bbc6f45ec81aba4f1e672c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c1bbc6f45ec81aba4f1e672c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! You've gained so much from your own experience. Your passion and hard work to help others is awesome. Keep it up, you're making a big impact!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-1700f4dc29cb6bd5dd764091", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.572818+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1700f4dc29cb6bd5dd764091", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1700f4dc29cb6bd5dd764091", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! Your kind words mean a lot."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-702273cf1d1d6a4b65bf7ddb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.584315+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "702273cf1d1d6a4b65bf7ddb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "702273cf1d1d6a4b65bf7ddb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Congrats Caroline! Good on you for going after what you really care about."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-26/session_4-520278e3efaf698f088e9753", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:45:14.592328+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "520278e3efaf698f088e9753", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "520278e3efaf698f088e9753", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
